<title>USA: Gateway offers x2 high-speed modem card.</title>
<headline>Gateway offers x2 high-speed modem card.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH SIOUX CITY, S.D. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer direct marketer Gateway 2000 Inc said Monday it is offering PC Card modems usings x2 high-speed technology from U.S. Robotics Corp.</p>
<p>The modems are an upgrade option on Gateway's Solo multimedia notebook line. The price is $200.</p>
<p>The x2 technology allows users to download information from the Internet and other networks at speeds up to 56 kilobits per second over telephone lines.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
